❗️ The Armed Forces of the Russian Federation continue to launch group strikes against Ukrainian logistics facilities and vessels, used in the interests of the Armed Forces of Ukraine.

💥 During the day, the following targets were neutralised by attack drones:

▫️ in Usatovo (Odessa region), a logistics centre used to store and distribute military cargo;

▫️ in the port of Yuzhny, a dry cargo ship with military equipment of the Armed Forces of Ukraine;

▫️ in the Black Sea waters, a dry cargo ship with weapons and ammunition.

🔹 Russian Defence Ministry

